WEBVTT

00:11.668 --> 00:12.760
Ruri!

00:14.738 --> 00:15.727
Chelsea...

00:16.006 --> 00:17.735
What are you doing?!

00:18.241 --> 00:19.071
I'm sweeping.

00:19.142 --> 00:20.769
I know that.

00:21.044 --> 00:22.875
What about your recovery?

00:23.246 --> 00:24.474
I'm okay now.

00:26.650 --> 00:27.639
Besides...

00:27.851 --> 00:31.685
We're taking shelter here.
I should do some cleanup.

00:37.561 --> 00:39.119
I'll help you.

00:39.629 --> 00:43.030
I doubt you've done
much cleaning like this.

00:43.099 --> 00:46.830
The trick is to gather
the flower petals in one place.

00:51.308 --> 00:53.299
Gather the flower petals...

00:56.746 --> 00:58.077
That's great.

00:58.582 --> 01:01.847
I'll use my gravity power to add
weight to those flower petals!

01:10.093 --> 01:12.459
Let's pretend we didn't see that.

01:13.263 --> 01:13.786
Sure.

01:17.033 --> 01:18.125
I overslept!

01:21.438 --> 01:22.996
Gotta hurry!

01:25.342 --> 01:27.139
He didn't see it.

01:27.844 --> 01:30.438
Hey! Hey!

01:30.580 --> 01:32.104
Rumina!

01:32.949 --> 01:35.884
If you don't hurry,
you'll be late for school!

01:37.354 --> 01:39.345
Good morning, Ruri, Chelsea.

01:39.856 --> 01:41.255
Good morning.

01:41.992 --> 01:42.617
Um...

01:43.593 --> 01:46.926
Are you and Rumina
going somewhere?

01:47.664 --> 01:48.153
Huh?

01:48.398 --> 01:50.389
Yeah, we're going to school.

01:50.467 --> 01:51.934
Sorry to keep you waiting!

01:52.569 --> 01:54.161
Ginnosuke!

01:56.773 --> 01:57.967
We're off!

02:05.448 --> 02:10.147
The abandoned subway line leads
into darkness.

02:10.420 --> 02:13.389
At the end of this long,
long tunnel...

02:13.723 --> 02:17.352
...beneath Tokyo, this nation's capital...

02:18.228 --> 02:22.221
...there is a forgotten world
that has been sealed off.

02:22.432 --> 02:26.334
The name of this world where
the sun does not shine is...

02:49.326 --> 02:52.921
yoru no machi wa tsumetai ne

02:52.996 --> 02:56.454
kokoro umore naku nari sou

02:56.533 --> 02:59.969
mae ni susumeru ka douka daro

03:00.036 --> 03:02.664
taisetsu na koto wa

03:02.839 --> 03:05.034
oshiete yo

03:05.108 --> 03:06.837
ne

03:06.910 --> 03:11.745
hito wa hanareru tameni deau no?

03:11.815 --> 03:16.878
Machigai dato omowa sete

03:17.287 --> 03:20.984
akireru hodoni aishiteta

03:21.057 --> 03:24.652
nani mo kamo ga kira meite

03:24.728 --> 03:28.095
osoreru koto nante nani

03:28.164 --> 03:31.895
hitotsu naito shinji teta

03:31.968 --> 03:35.426
jyonetsu ga oto wo tatete

03:35.505 --> 03:38.997
kuzure ochiru shun kan wo

03:39.075 --> 03:42.511
wasure wa shinai itsu made mo

03:42.579 --> 03:46.015
modori tai nante iwa nai yo

03:46.082 --> 03:52.282
tada kimi ni mou ichido dake aitai.

04:05.168 --> 04:06.236
Full Moon - Ruri's Wish

04:06.236 --> 04:08.905
Full Moon - Ruri's Wish
Full Moon - Ruri's Wish.

04:08.905 --> 04:12.534
Full Moon - Ruri's Wish

04:13.777 --> 04:15.677
School?

04:16.079 --> 04:16.875
Yes.

04:17.380 --> 04:18.745
Let's see...

04:19.282 --> 04:22.376
School is where
many people gather...

04:22.452 --> 04:24.386
...to learn about many subjects.

04:25.388 --> 04:27.253
I suppose that's
the best explanation.

04:27.757 --> 04:28.849
Oh...

04:29.359 --> 04:30.553
What about it?

04:30.694 --> 04:31.888
Oh, nothing.

04:34.130 --> 04:37.327
I was just wondering
where Rumina was going.

04:37.400 --> 04:39.300
He was so excited and happy.

04:48.745 --> 04:50.770
I'll go and sweep over there.

04:54.851 --> 04:56.751
It's been one week...

04:57.587 --> 05:01.284
It's a relief Ruri
was able to recover so well.

05:01.958 --> 05:05.951
Is the Company being cautious
after learning about his abilities?

05:06.663 --> 05:07.459
No.

05:09.132 --> 05:10.793
This isn't a time to be complacent.

05:15.238 --> 05:16.671
Is this it?

05:16.973 --> 05:18.804
The temple where he lives?

05:20.877 --> 05:22.868
The sucker punched me
that first day...

05:22.946 --> 05:24.743
...but it won't be so easy today!

05:24.948 --> 05:27.974
I'll show him who the boss is!

05:31.621 --> 05:33.646
I challenge you! Rumina Asagi!

05:34.257 --> 05:35.918
Can I help you with something?

05:36.626 --> 05:37.752
Uh, um...

05:41.164 --> 05:43.962
Maybe you wanted
to see Rumina?

05:44.400 --> 05:45.526
Uh, yeah!

05:45.735 --> 05:46.861
Boss?

05:48.438 --> 05:50.030
She's so cute...!

05:51.407 --> 05:53.637
Would you please...!

05:56.913 --> 05:59.245
B-Boss!

05:59.616 --> 06:03.052
B-Boss, get a grip on yourself!

06:03.353 --> 06:06.686
Ruri, don't talk
to boys like them.

06:06.890 --> 06:07.481
Right.

06:08.391 --> 06:10.621
Are those people from his school?

06:12.595 --> 06:15.223
They're wearing
the same clothes as Rumina.

06:20.403 --> 06:22.564
You want me to take you to school?

06:23.139 --> 06:23.730
Yes.

06:24.974 --> 06:26.100
Can I go?

06:26.643 --> 06:27.803
I can take you there!

06:28.678 --> 06:33.172
I guess this will be like
a date or something, right?

06:33.683 --> 06:35.412
I don't think so...

06:35.618 --> 06:37.415
And to school, even!

06:37.487 --> 06:40.581
This could be something
truly romantic!

06:41.024 --> 06:41.854
No!

06:43.459 --> 06:45.893
I can't allow her to leave here.

06:46.563 --> 06:50.124
Do you understand what kind
of danger you could be in?

06:52.869 --> 06:56.669
It's just that, until now,
I was always kept alone...

06:56.739 --> 06:58.229
...by the Company.

06:58.308 --> 07:01.641
So I was curious about places
where people gather.

07:02.011 --> 07:03.535
But Ruri...

07:03.613 --> 07:06.673
We don't know where and when
a Company agent will appear.

07:07.250 --> 07:09.445
But that could happen here, too.

07:09.652 --> 07:13.179
What the heck is this
"Company" thing anyway?

07:13.256 --> 07:15.315
Why are they after Ruri?

07:16.860 --> 07:20.091
The Company rules the Underground.

07:20.163 --> 07:24.725
Ruri is the key to the
Company realizing its plans.

07:25.301 --> 07:26.359
Key?

07:27.170 --> 07:29.229
You mean the power
of resurrection?

07:29.706 --> 07:30.502
Huh?

07:31.374 --> 07:32.238
Anyway!

07:33.109 --> 07:34.872
They're after Ruri.

07:35.111 --> 07:36.908
And maybe you as well.

07:37.714 --> 07:40.740
They might be watching us right now.

07:42.452 --> 07:44.443
So, Ruri, please...

07:44.821 --> 07:46.083
But I...

07:46.789 --> 07:48.586
I know I'm asking a lot.

07:48.658 --> 07:51.126
But I want to see
more of this world...

07:51.194 --> 07:52.889
...while I have the chance!

07:52.962 --> 07:54.156
Ruri...

07:55.765 --> 07:56.527
Please.

07:57.800 --> 07:59.324
Why not?

08:00.603 --> 08:03.265
I'll take her to my school.

08:03.473 --> 08:04.235
Okay?

08:05.475 --> 08:06.533
I want to go!

08:06.676 --> 08:07.836
I'm going!

08:10.980 --> 08:11.947
All right.

08:16.886 --> 08:18.319
Metropolitan Asahina
Senior High School

08:23.459 --> 08:24.585
Wow!

08:26.329 --> 08:27.819
It's huge!

08:30.633 --> 08:32.624
This is a school?

08:33.303 --> 08:34.827
Well, it's a bit run-down.

08:43.613 --> 08:46.878
Chelsea didn't even
come out of her room.

08:48.117 --> 08:49.812
That violent crazy girl...

08:49.886 --> 08:53.117
...can stay and watch the house
all by herself for all I care.

08:57.460 --> 08:59.052
Pretty dingy, isn't it?

08:59.195 --> 09:02.961
Everyday we come to this
place to learn stuff.

09:09.138 --> 09:10.264
I understand.

09:11.107 --> 09:14.201
I am sensing a lot in this room.

09:14.610 --> 09:17.101
The presence... of people...

09:19.816 --> 09:21.010
You want to sit down?

09:22.118 --> 09:24.052
There's only three of us today...

09:24.120 --> 09:27.055
...but usually this room
is full of people during class.

09:27.523 --> 09:28.319
Class?

09:28.758 --> 09:31.852
That's right. And we take
attendance at the beginning.

09:32.295 --> 09:35.856
To check whether people are absent.

09:36.366 --> 09:37.230
Oh...

09:38.835 --> 09:42.601
You have to answer
when your name is called out.

09:42.772 --> 09:44.069
Rumina Asagi!

09:44.173 --> 09:45.003
Here!

09:46.275 --> 09:47.367
Ruri Sarasa!

09:47.877 --> 09:48.901
Uh, here!

09:55.051 --> 09:57.611
Chelsea Rorec. I'm late.

10:02.458 --> 10:04.892
I thought you were
watching the house.

10:05.962 --> 10:08.430
Aren't you going to start class?

10:08.498 --> 10:09.556
Chelsea...

10:10.133 --> 10:12.863
I am your bodyguard after all.

10:12.969 --> 10:15.597
Of course I should be here!

10:15.738 --> 10:19.265
I bet you were just getting lonely.

10:19.776 --> 10:22.244
What do you think I am?

10:22.578 --> 10:24.705
I'll beat you senseless!

10:27.483 --> 10:28.780
Um, Rumina?

10:28.851 --> 10:29.840
What's the matter?

10:29.919 --> 10:33.650
I've found it very strange ever
since I first came here.

10:33.723 --> 10:36.385
That light...
How does it float like that?

10:37.660 --> 10:39.025
There's no ceiling.

10:39.729 --> 10:40.491
Ceiling?

10:41.030 --> 10:42.258
That's the moon.

10:42.465 --> 10:43.762
It's a full moon tonight.

10:43.900 --> 10:44.798
Moon?

10:45.668 --> 10:48.296
Why is it a different shape
from the other day?

10:48.671 --> 10:51.231
It wasn't so round the last time.

10:52.341 --> 10:56.004
That's because...
Well, let's see...

10:56.079 --> 10:58.047
It's like this... Um...

10:58.114 --> 11:00.139
Ginnosuke! You explain it to her!

11:00.450 --> 11:01.781
What? Me?!

11:01.851 --> 11:04.615
The moon is a satellite
that orbits the earth.

11:04.687 --> 11:07.815
A satellite goes
around the earth.

11:07.890 --> 11:11.348
As it goes around, the sun's light
strikes it from different angles.

11:11.427 --> 11:14.157
Sometimes it looks big and round,
other times thin and narrow.

11:14.230 --> 11:15.720
It's beautiful.

11:17.366 --> 11:18.833
All right! It's decided!

11:18.901 --> 11:20.163
Next time, just the two of us...

11:20.236 --> 11:21.828
Just the two of you?

11:22.271 --> 11:24.569
I'll take her on a date,
and I'll...

11:24.640 --> 11:25.334
You'll what?

11:25.408 --> 11:27.205
I'm going to...!

11:29.612 --> 11:31.580
What're you doing,
you violent freak woman?!

11:31.647 --> 11:33.080
Shut up, you creep!

11:33.282 --> 11:34.146
What'd you say?!

11:34.317 --> 11:36.785
How dare you think of
making a move on Ruri!

11:36.853 --> 11:37.820
What do you mean by that?!

11:42.758 --> 11:47.024
How could they idly watch
the moon in a place like this?

11:49.098 --> 11:52.625
I suppose it's all right.

11:54.370 --> 11:58.534
This will be the last time
they'll see the moon, after all.

12:05.181 --> 12:06.808
It's a beautiful moon.

12:07.583 --> 12:11.075
It's not something that those
from the Company get to see.

12:11.154 --> 12:14.419
Have a good look at it,
Maiden of Life...

12:16.192 --> 12:17.489
...Ruri Sarasa!

12:22.498 --> 12:24.932
I feel as though someone
called my name.

12:25.334 --> 12:26.824
What's the matter, Ruri?

12:27.236 --> 12:31.400
It's nothing. I've never come
to a place like this before.

12:31.474 --> 12:33.237
I was in a daze.

12:35.378 --> 12:36.140
Hey!

12:37.146 --> 12:38.704
Let's get onto the field.

12:39.015 --> 12:39.640
Sure!

12:44.487 --> 12:45.818
What's the field?

12:45.888 --> 12:49.051
Uh, how can I explain it...

12:50.226 --> 12:53.024
Maybe it was good
to come here.

12:53.329 --> 12:56.662
I get to see Ruri enjoy life a little,
after all.

13:04.140 --> 13:07.473
Maybe it's
a little too cold outside.

13:07.543 --> 13:09.135
It's kind of chilly, you know.

13:09.212 --> 13:10.076
Huh?

13:10.546 --> 13:11.308
Here.

13:12.215 --> 13:15.116
You could catch a cold
dressed like that.

13:15.184 --> 13:16.811
What about you?

13:16.886 --> 13:17.853
Don't worry about me.

13:17.920 --> 13:19.581
I've got no problem with this!

13:20.122 --> 13:21.851
Right, Ginnosuke?!

13:22.758 --> 13:25.693
I guess an idiot doesn't catch a cold.

13:26.629 --> 13:27.118
Right.

13:29.665 --> 13:31.223
What do you mean by that?!

13:35.538 --> 13:39.133
To think the Maiden would
befriend such a barbaric man.

13:39.208 --> 13:40.300
How inappropriate!

13:42.445 --> 13:43.377
Ruri!

13:45.815 --> 13:46.873
A prison of water?!

13:47.583 --> 13:48.811
This trick is...!

13:49.819 --> 13:51.081
Great Water Formation!

13:59.061 --> 13:59.686
Ruri!

14:11.540 --> 14:13.701
So, you call her by her name.

14:17.346 --> 14:20.747
No one in the Company
calls her that.

14:22.184 --> 14:23.981
Rumina, user of wind.

14:24.387 --> 14:26.355
How do you know my name?!

14:30.760 --> 14:32.091
Never mind that!

14:32.161 --> 14:33.992
You get away from Ruri!

14:34.430 --> 14:35.795
I knew it was him!

14:37.433 --> 14:39.298
If you want the Maiden back...

14:39.368 --> 14:41.029
...you're going to have to
come over here.

14:42.605 --> 14:44.436
Rumina...

14:47.243 --> 14:48.107
I'm waiting.

14:48.778 --> 14:49.540
Ginnosuke!

14:50.212 --> 14:50.906
Yeah!

14:52.281 --> 14:54.715
You lay a hand on Ruri
and I'll kill you!

14:55.284 --> 14:57.980
You fool! There's no way
you can fight him alone!

15:08.064 --> 15:10.294
I will be your opponent.

15:12.601 --> 15:18.938
Betraying the Company is going
to cost you, Chelsea Rorec.

15:20.776 --> 15:21.265
Pairon...

15:33.089 --> 15:34.681
So there you are!

15:39.328 --> 15:40.295
Ruri!

15:41.530 --> 15:42.554
Are you hurt?!

15:43.265 --> 15:46.200
Let's go while
tail head's gone!

16:02.385 --> 16:03.113
What?!

16:05.588 --> 16:06.850
It's a water shadow.

16:07.289 --> 16:10.884
I have the ability to freely
manipulate shapes of water.

16:12.962 --> 16:17.296
I didn't think you'd fall for that
so easily.

16:17.933 --> 16:18.900
Tail head!

16:20.369 --> 16:22.303
You're awfully rude.

16:24.840 --> 16:26.637
I am Teil Ashford.

16:27.643 --> 16:29.838
I'm interested in your power.

16:30.579 --> 16:32.206
I want to test it out.

16:32.681 --> 16:35.172
Shut up!
Ruri better be all right!

16:35.851 --> 16:36.840
Of course.

16:37.286 --> 16:40.255
I'm the only one
who can dissolve...

16:40.322 --> 16:42.347
...the water net that holds her.

16:43.726 --> 16:45.387
Even your "wind" won't do it.

16:45.461 --> 16:47.190
Oh, yeah? Great!

16:47.730 --> 16:49.994
Just watch me
blow you away!

16:53.469 --> 16:54.401
I wonder if you can do it...

16:56.705 --> 16:59.367
What's the matter?
You haven't even touched me.

17:07.416 --> 17:08.940
Great Flood
Great Flood!

17:13.622 --> 17:16.284
To think he can manipulate
this much water at once!

17:18.594 --> 17:19.618
You!

17:21.464 --> 17:22.658
Tidal Fist!

17:28.671 --> 17:31.697
Even Chelsea's no match for him.

17:32.341 --> 17:33.638
Who could that be?

17:36.645 --> 17:40.172
So he's the second most powerful
man in the Company?

17:42.918 --> 17:46.410
To think the Maiden's bodyguard
is this weak.

17:46.489 --> 17:48.923
Our Leader has made
a bad judgment call.

17:49.124 --> 17:50.921
You misunderstand.

17:50.993 --> 17:54.622
The Company didn't
make me her bodyguard.

17:54.697 --> 17:58.656
The Maiden is not
who I'm protecting.

17:59.301 --> 18:00.359
It's Ruri!

18:16.118 --> 18:17.278
N-No way...

18:17.653 --> 18:20.816
He's using a wall of water to
suppress her powerful gravity!

18:25.194 --> 18:26.718
When I heard that Seki had
a hard time with you...

18:26.795 --> 18:29.628
...I wondered
what kind of power you had.

18:30.499 --> 18:31.966
But I'm sorely disappointed.

18:39.675 --> 18:40.232
He's strong...

18:45.080 --> 18:46.308
That bastard!

18:46.448 --> 18:47.779
Where is he hiding?!

18:51.921 --> 18:52.649
There!

18:54.823 --> 18:55.881
Damn!

18:56.125 --> 18:58.992
I've finally learned
to control it somewhat...

18:59.395 --> 19:01.226
...but the power's still too weak.

19:02.331 --> 19:06.131
Come to think of it, that tail head
is only using illusions!

19:06.802 --> 19:09.999
Instead of sneaking around,
come on out and fight me!

19:15.945 --> 19:17.537
The power of wind.

19:17.613 --> 19:21.276
The ability to control the flow of
air and create a sword out of it.

19:22.184 --> 19:23.845
It's an interesting power...

19:23.919 --> 19:26.615
...but it's a waste if
the man wielding it is an idiot.

19:26.689 --> 19:28.987
How dare you!
I'll blow you away!

19:45.941 --> 19:48.273
There. I got you cornered.

19:50.446 --> 19:51.970
Prepare yourself!

19:52.481 --> 19:54.949
For my power of wind!

20:01.056 --> 20:04.321
I can't access my power.
My energy is draining!

20:04.393 --> 20:05.826
That's expected.

20:05.894 --> 20:06.553
What?!

20:06.629 --> 20:10.121
You used more power
than you had to.

20:11.100 --> 20:14.797
The amount of energy
each power user can produce is limited.

20:15.504 --> 20:17.233
It's unfortunate for you.

20:17.306 --> 20:19.137
But I'm taking
the Maiden with me.

20:25.180 --> 20:26.272
Ruri!

20:43.832 --> 20:48.531
Kyoumo uso no youni

20:48.604 --> 20:54.600
migakareru machi nami wo

20:54.677 --> 21:06.953
mokuteki ga aruyou ni
aruku boku

21:07.823 --> 21:18.757
naiteruno?
Honno sasayaka na kakotachi yo

21:18.834 --> 21:30.006
miagereba
DIGITAL no SCREEN ni sora ga...

21:31.046 --> 21:40.011
kaze no uta wo
takai kaidan wo nobori

21:40.089 --> 21:43.581
kikou to shita

21:43.659 --> 21:51.930
daite
amaku kizu tsuita yume ga mou

21:52.000 --> 22:00.601
same temo ii
nakanaide

22:09.852 --> 22:11.786
Preview

22:13.522 --> 22:16.980
At first, I thought she was
just a big hassle to have around.

22:17.726 --> 22:20.490
But when she first held my hand...

22:21.130 --> 22:23.894
...I decided I would
protect Ruri no matter what!

22:24.333 --> 22:26.358
That's why I will never give up!

22:26.935 --> 22:28.800
You just watch, tail head!

22:29.738 --> 22:32.298
Next time on
Tokyo Underground...

22:32.374 --> 22:34.865
..."Fight - The Two
Water Users."

22:34.943 --> 22:39.744
Fight - The
Two Water Users
